<title>CANADA: DBRS puts UGG, wheat pools under review.</title>
<headline>DBRS puts UGG, wheat pools under review.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dominion Bond Rating Service said on Thursday it has placed its ratings on United Grain Growers Ltd, Alberta Wheat Pool and Manitoba Pool Elevators under review with negative implications.</p>
<p>The ratings agency announced the move after Alberta Wheat Pool and Manitoba Pool launched a C$172 million takeover bid for United Grain Growers earlier today.</p>
</text>
